---
---

<section class="services" id="services">
  <div class="services-inner">
    <p class="eyebrow">What I Do</p>
    <h2>Services built around your work</h2>
    <p class="lead">
      Simple, fast websites that are easy to manage — and easy for your
      visitors to use.
    </p>

    <div class="cards">
      <article class="card">
        <p class="num">01</p>
        <h3>WordPress Websites</h3>
        <p>
          Fast, easy-to-manage websites for businesses, institutions and
          scholars — built with WordPress and Elementor.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="card">
        <p class="num">02</p>
        <h3>LMS Platforms</h3>
        <p>
          Online courses and academies with lessons, students and
          enrolments — built on Tutor LMS.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="card">
        <p class="num">03</p>
        <h3>SEO-Friendly Sites</h3>
        <p>
          Sites built to be found on Google, with local SEO in mind — so
          nearby customers can reach you first.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .services {
    background: #ffffff;
    color: #111111;
  }

  .services-inner {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 80px 24px;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 12px;
    color: #ff2e88;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.22em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  h2 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 4vw, 2.8rem);
    line-height: 1.15;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .lead {
    max-width: 560px;
    margin: 16px 0 0;
    color: #555555;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .cards {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 24px;
    margin-top: 48px;
  }

  .card {
    padding: 32px 28px;
    border: 1px solid #e8e8f0;
    border-radius: 16px;
    background: #f8f8fc;
  }

  .num {
    margin: 0 0 16px;
    color: #ff2e88;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 800;
  }

  .card h3 {
    margin: 0 0 10px;
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .card p:last-child {
    margin: 0;
    color: #555555;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  @media (max-width: 820px) {
    .services-inner {
      padding: 56px 24px;
    }

    .cards {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
